<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Dec unemployment falls yr/yr to 13.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian Dec unemployment falls yr/yr to 13.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Employment Office released the following unemployment data -</p>
<p>    BELGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	   DEC 96     NOV 96     DEC 1995</p>
<p>    Total registered jobless (*) 580,166    578,665    615,830</p>
<p>    Pct of workforce		 13.6	 13.5	 14.5</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) all registered unemployed, whether or not they receive unemployment benefits.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
